        "summary": "This conversation created and refined the first graph in the Q&A collection:\n\n• Defined the reusable seven-class Q&A template\n• Created the public Q&A collection and repository-root portal\n• Built “How Will Graph-Based Interfaces Change the Web?”\n• Diagnosed class-view 404 failures\n• Replaced website-relative class references with durable github:// references\n• Added this provenance record to preserve the graph’s origin",
